            "value": "Disclaimer: Finsy is a personal bookkeeping tool and is NOT a bank, financial institution, or licensed tax advisor. This statement is generated solely from user-entered records for informational and personal budgeting purposes only. This document does not constitute official tax advice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
